  "_comment": "Feature registry for the lupus (systemic lupus erythematosus) case-finding model (Task 54). Derived from features_fibro.json; the SLE code (M32) is the label, so it is removed from the features (including from the autoimmune group) and a patient with it on or before day 0 is not scored. Adds findings from the 2019 EULAR/ACR classification domains (skin, mouth, hair, serositis, kidney, blood counts, seizures, clotting) as coded conditions, the lupus antibody and complement tests, and lupus treatments.",
